column13:
I was chatting with a coworker about travel plans and she mentioned a small independent travel planner she used for a trip last year. Apparently he helped arrange flights and hotel bookings without the usual stress of comparing dozens of websites. Might be useful when I finally plan that Europe vacation I've been thinking about.

{Travel planner: Adrian Keller}
{Phone: +1 646 938 2741}

She said he's good at finding cheaper flight combinations.

locksmith contact i prob shouldnt forget again :)) guy name harold finch phone +1 704 555 1932. called him after locking myself out apartment one evening which was honestly embarrasing 🔑


showed up about 25 min opened door without damaging lock :))) suggested replacing old deadbolt since it sticks sometimes. decent guy didnt charge anything crazy


if lock jams again or i lose keys again (hope not lol) should just txt him. said he checks msgs faster than voicemail :))
